## Summary and Quick Reference

### Terminal Interaction Checklist
- [ ] Execute ONE command at a time
- [ ] WAIT for complete output before proceeding
- [ ] VERIFY command success through output analysis
- [ ] TRACK current directory and environment state
- [ ] USE platform-appropriate commands
- [ ] HANDLE errors gracefully with recovery strategies
- [ ] LOG all operations for debugging
- [ ] VALIDATE state before and after operations
- [ ] RESPECT safety protocols for dangerous commands
- [ ] MAINTAIN awareness of long-running processes
